kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"import (upload) icon\"></i>Import</button>\n<button class=\"flex h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[var(--primary)] px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--on-primary)] shadow-[var(--shadow)] hover:opacity-90\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"add item button\"><i class=\"mdi mdi-plus text-lg\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"plus icon\"></i>Add item</button>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"mt-4 flex min-h-0 flex-1 gap-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"screen body columns\">\n<!-- Inventory -->\n<section class=\"flex w-[838px] shrink-0 flex-col rounded-2xl bg-[var(--card)] p-4 shadow-[var(--shadow)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"inventory section\">\n<label class=\"flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--edge)] bg-[var(--well)] px-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"search bar\">\n<i class=\"mdi mdi-magnify text-xl text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"magnifying glass icon\"></i>\n<input class=\"h-full flex-1 bg-transparent text-sm outline-hidden placeholder:text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"search input field\" placeholder=\"Search item name, SKU or barcode\"/>\n<span class=\"rounded-md border border-[var(--edge)] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"keyboard shortcut hint pill\">Ctrl K</span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex h-10 items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"status filter tabs group\">\n<button class=\"flex h-9 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)] pr-1.5 pl-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--on-primary)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"all items filter tab active\">All items <span class=\"rounded-full bg-[var(--teal)] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"item count badge\">100</span></button>\n<button class=\"flex h-9 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(-