mn header\">Name <i class=\"mdi mdi-unfold-more-horizontal\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"sort expand icon\"></i></span>\n<span data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"SKU column header\">SKU</span><span data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-4\" data-name=\"barcode column header\">Barcode</span><span data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-5\" data-name=\"unit column header\">Unit</span>\n<span class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-6\" data-name=\"cost column header\">Cost</span>\n<span class=\"flex items-center justify-end gap-0.5 text-[var(--text)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-7\" data-name=\"price column header with sort icon\">Price <i class=\"mdi mdi-arrow-up text-[var(--teal)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-7-1\" data-name=\"ascending sort arrow icon\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-8\" data-name=\"stock column header\">Stock</span>\n<span data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-9\" data-name=\"expiry column header\">Expiry</span><span data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-10\" data-name=\"actions column header spacer\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"inventory table rows container\" data-reason=\"innerHTML replaced by script rendering item rows\" data-rows=\"\"></div>\n<footer class=\"flex h-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-between border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"pagination footer\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"pagination range text\"><b class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--text)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"current page range text\">41–60</b> of 100 items</span>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"pagination controls\">\n<button class=\"flex h-10 items-center gap-1 rounded-xl border border-[var(--edge)] pr-4 pl-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold hover:bg-[var(--hover)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"previous page button\"><i class=\"